WEBVTT

00:13:55.371 --> 00:14:00.871
on diversity, equity
and inclusion -- what we call DEI --

00:14:01.996 --> 00:14:05.329
my message to CEOs is reassuring:

00:14:05.371 --> 00:14:07.079
you already know what to do.

00:14:07.079 --> 00:14:09.579
Use standard business tools,

00:14:09.621 --> 00:14:11.329
start from the evidence,

00:14:12.496 --> 00:14:17.287
gather metrics to establish baselines
and measure progress

00:14:17.287 --> 00:14:20.787
and keep at it
until you achieve your goals.

00:14:21.246 --> 00:14:24.079
That's the new DEI playbook.

00:14:24.912 --> 00:14:26.121
And it works.

00:14:27.496 --> 00:14:28.871
Thank you.